    "body": "Refs ed3c/soodles#53\n\nThis atom removes the recovery deadlock observed after Issue #51 without replaying its provider writes.\n\nBehavioral change:\n\n- `landing resume` may migrate a completed checkpoint from `awaiting_reconcile` as well as `reconciling`;\n- every claim field except the selected verifier digest remains fixed;\n- a cloud-only delivery with no candidate path, branch, or worktree registration persists `cleanup_intent.mode=no_op` and `phase=reconciling` before Git synchronization;\n- any branch or registration refuses the no-op path;\n- existing Noodle-owned cleanup remains unchanged for resources that exist;\n- terminal receipts expose `local.cleanup_mode`.\n\nFocused evidence before PR:\n\n- 108 discovered unit tests passed with no skips;\n- cleanup recovery oracle passed five existing SIGKILL/recovery cases plus one new `cloud_noop` case;\n- the new case migrated from `awaiting_reconcile`, emitted zero provider requests, invoked no worktree deletion, and left zero residue;\n- the updated `verify-soodles` skill passed its structural validator.\n\nThe historical #51 RED receipt remains unchanged. This candidate does not claim authority for its own landing or for the eventual #51 terminal reconciliation.",
