    "body": "## Intent\n\nRemove the single recovery deadlock observed after Issue #51 provider delivery. A cloud Session may legitimately have no local candidate branch, worktree path or registration. The landing owner must migrate the completed checkpoint to an independently accepted verifier and record that proven absence as no-op cleanup without replaying provider writes.\n\nThis atom owns the two inseparable transitions in the same durable owner:\n\n1. verifier migration from `awaiting_reconcile` after completed provider writes;\n2. reconciliation when the candidate path, branch and registration were never created locally.\n\nIt does not rerun the Issue #51 behavior comparison, add a scheduler, create a synthetic worktree, change provider identity or replay merge/close.\n\n## Observed defect\n\nThe preserved [Issue #51 delivery receipt](https://github.com/ed3c/soodles/blob/9b7a33976a9cf35b0d1cc807d03d4659d6f0fbac/docs/experiments/pclass-behavior-51/delivery/delivery-receipt.json) records:\n\n- provider merge and Issue closure complete;\n- checkpoint phase `awaiting_reconcile`;\n- `writes_offered == [\"merge\", \"close\"]`;\n- candidate branch/worktree absent;\n- old owner refusal `worktree.path=missing before cleanup intent`;\n- Git fetch not reached.\n\nThe current `landing resume` accepts only `reconciling`. The old verifier cannot reach that phase, while a corrected verifier cannot replace the pinned digest. This is a closed recovery deadlock.\n\n## Executable contract\n\n### Positive\n\nA supervisor-selected corrected verifier may migrate a checkpoint from `awaiting_reconcile` only when:\n\n- `merge_sha` and `issue_closed_at` are present;\n- `writes_offered` is exactly `[\"merge\", \"close\"]`;\n- every claim field except `verifier_sha256` is byte-for-byte unchanged;\n- the verifier di…2203 tokens truncated…tsr37t2jBpw7IGe9l7nCbUaStFo7vIAXuWCmMb9nr5rr8\n/wNFOfzsuio/0sPiIAnkMgNFzs64huY/jvdoPS+KKElWzDqNJXgVv5Dm2cFVHkrr\nvY76IyProKJL2uMRgGEa\n=TuqQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
          "payload": "tree 6a48fd9b7c04bf964bc0b129acdf8d0566ac01d5\nparent f3e54c25caac833b1ce2970aaebfb4e1d75defa0\nparent a2bb0baf5905d63fe9609f2b52032ce04ab137ee\nauthor ed3c <30064024+ed3c@users.noreply.github.com> 1789700298 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789700298 +0800\n\nMerge pull request #54 from ed3c/issue-53-cloud-noop-reconcile\n\nAllow cloud-only no-op landing reconciliation",
          "verified_at": "2026-09-18T02:58:19Z"
        }
      },
